'''Loris''' (ダテメガネル, ''Datemeganeru'') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[LeMurr]] introduced in [[Uncanny Legends]]. He was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

