==Trivia==
*A [[wikipedia:Loris|loris]] is a slow-moving nocturnal primate known for its huge eyes. Unlike the [[The Battle Cats|Battle Cats]] enemy, however, real lorises generally don't have tails.
*His Japanese name, Datemeganeru, is derived from the words 伊達 ''date'' (vain/stylish), 伊達眼鏡 ''date megane'' (fake glasses) and 眼鏡猿 ''meganezaru'' ([[wikipedia:Tarsier|tarsier]]).
*His attack animation, in which he throws his shades-like eyes, may be a visual pun on the slang term "[[wikipedia:Throw shade|throw shade]]" (to subtly or indirectly express contempt for someone or something).

